cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SO3C: Lorentz-covariant jet tagging with complexified-SO(3) geodesic flows"
abstract: "Jet taggers built on the complexified rotation algebra so(3) + i so(3) = so(3,C), which is isomorphic to the Lorentz algebra so(3,1). Each particle carries a complex 3-vector moved along the closed-form flow z' = -[a] x z by a learned covariant connection; the flow conserves the bilinear invariant z.z and is evaluated with a complex Rodrigues formula, so no ODE solver is involved. Includes the benchmark harness used to measure the taggers on the Kasieczka top-tagging reference dataset."
authors:
